window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Once upon a time, a vampire fell in love with a hunter…</b></p> <p>The trials for the heir of the city have begun, and the stakes have never been higher.</p> <p>Red, a hunter, is struggling with her growing hunger for blood and the truth of her identity.</p> <p>Octavia Beaumont, one of the original three vampires, is determined to win the trials and take control of the city.</p> <p>But as Red and Octavia navigate deadly challenges and political machinations, they must also confront the lies and betrayals that have shaped their past.</p> <p>Memories have been stolen.</p> <p>Secrets have been kept.</p> <p>And the line between love and hate has never been more blurred.</p> <p>As the trials progress, Red and Octavia's bond grows stronger, but so does the target on their backs. Enemies lurk in every shadow, and even allies can no longer be trusted.</p> <p>To survive the trials and uncover the truth...</p> <p>They must decide how much they're willing to sacrifice.</p> <p>Confront the monsters they've become.</p> <p>And embrace a destiny that could destroy everything they hold dear.</p> <p>But in a world where blood is power and love is a weakness, can Red and Octavia emerge victorious? Or will their secrets be their undoing?</p> <p><i>This is a dark and steamy lesbian vampire romance with a generous dose of enemies-to-lovers, fated mates, and political intrigue. Featuring a snarky dhampir heroine and a morally grey vampire queen. Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
